  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mi>S</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p><p>The possible ordered pairs are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mi>E</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://